<title>USA: Data Processing to file 2.2 mln shr offer.</title>
<headline>Data Processing to file 2.2 mln shr offer.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT BEACH, Calif. 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Data Processing Resources Corp said Wednesday it intends to file within the next week with the Securities and Exchange Commission for a secondary offering of about 2,200,000 shares.</p>
<p>The company expects to offer about 2.0 million shares, with the balance to be offered by shareholders.</p>
<p>Company proceeds will be used for future acquisitions, the opening of new offices, working capital, and other general corporate purposes, the company said.</p>
